paradigm_comparison:
**Not just order:**
```css
/* This won't win just because it's later: */
p { color: blue; }

/* This WILL win (more specific): */
div.content p { color: red; }
```

**Specificity hierarchy:**
1. Inline styles (highest)
2. IDs (#id)
3. Classes, attributes, pseudo-classes (.class)
4. Elements (p, div)

More specific selectors win, regardless of order.

